d sent the second largest aerial  armada across the taiwan straits than  ever before and the largest was just a  few months earlier the reality is china  is continuing  to act in a menacing and a threatening  way toward taiwan  north korea actually fired seven  missiles  during the month of january alone so  again i say i say what i said in the  beginning weakness arouses evil  and whether it be north korea back to  firing missiles whether it be the  military provocations of china and the  taiwan straits or the south china sea  whether it  whether it be the  russian military now moving across the  border moving  uh into ukraine um we're learning once  again the lesson of history  that  that the free world is secure when  america is strong  and the world understands that we are  willing to use that strength to defend  our interests around the world  hey sean hannity here hey click here to  subscribe to fox news youtube page and  catch our hottest interviews and most  compelling analysis you will not get it  anywhere else

